n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.37.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 18th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Pirate Boat</b> is a shop in Oaklands. It sells high-tier explosives. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Pirate Boat is helmed by <a href=\"/wiki/Squallus_the_Salty_Seadog\" title=\"Squallus the Salty Seadog\">Squallus the Salty Seadog</a>.\n</p><p>The Pirate Boat itself moves between four specified locations: in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=28\">one of the branches</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=26\">on the far side</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Map:New_Oaklands_Map?marker=27\">on the east shore</a> of Ferwater, or underground In the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a> near the waterfall.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structures\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Structures\" title=\"Category:Structures\">Structures</a></big></span></h3>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:cente